25:06.440 --> 25:06.480
Tohno Takaki-sama

25:06.480 --> 25:06.520
Tohno Takaki-sama

25:06.520 --> 25:06.560
Tohno Takaki-sama

25:06.560 --> 25:06.600
Tohno Takaki-sama

25:06.600 --> 25:06.650
Tohno Takaki-sama

25:06.650 --> 25:06.690
Tohno Takaki-sama

25:06.690 --> 25:06.730
Tohno Takaki-sama

25:06.730 --> 25:06.770
Tohno Takaki-sama

25:06.770 --> 25:06.810
Tohno Takaki-sama

25:06.810 --> 25:06.860
Tohno Takaki-sama

25:06.860 --> 25:06.900
Tohno Takaki-sama

25:06.900 --> 25:06.940
Tohno Takaki-sama

25:06.940 --> 25:08.060
Tohno Takaki-sama

25:20.790 --> 25:25.380
All I wanted was the strength to protect her.

25:26.000 --> 25:33.390
With that thought in my mind, I continued to gaze out
over the landscape beyond the window... forever.

25:33.920 --> 25:47.400
“Story One: Cherry Blossom”

25:33.920 --> 25:47.400
End

25:55.530 --> 25:57.360
Story Two

27:01.890 --> 27:04.060
Kanae, are you going to go after school, too?

27:04.060 --> 27:05.850
Yeah, are you okay with that, Onee-chan?

27:05.850 --> 27:08.310
Fine by me. But be sure to get to your studies, too.

27:08.310 --> 27:09.440
Yeah.

27:39.850 --> 27:40.510
Okay!

27:55.240 --> 27:56.200
Morning.

27:56.700 --> 27:58.450
Good morning, Tohno-kun.

27:58.450 --> 27:59.910
You're really early this morning, huh?

27:59.910 --> 28:02.290
You too, Sumida. 
You went to the beach again, right?

28:02.290 --> 28:02.950
Yeah.

28:03.580 --> 28:05.200
You're practicing hard.

28:06.290 --> 28:09.000
I wouldn't say that...

28:09.000 --> 28:10.670
See you later, Tohno-kun.

28:10.670 --> 28:11.380
Later.

28:13.960 --> 28:16.630
Got it? It's time to begin making your choices.

28:16.630 --> 28:18.800
Be sure to turn it in by Monday, okay?

28:18.800 --> 28:21.350
And remember to talk it over with your parents before.

28:21.970 --> 28:26.300
C{*\c&H5F6D80&\frz357.788}a{*\c&H5E6C7F&\frz357.775}r{*\c&H5D6A7E&\frz357.762}e{*\c&H5C697D&\frz357.75}e{*\c&H5C687C&\frz357.738}r {*\c&H5A667A&\frz357.713}P{*\c&H596479&\frz357.7}l{*\c&H586378&\frz357.688}an {*\c&H566174&\frz357.65}Q{*\c&H556073&\frz357.637}u{*\c&H555F71&\frz357.625}e{*\c&H545F70&\frz357.613}s{*\c&H545E6E&\frz357.6}t{*\c&H535E6D&\frz357.587}i{*\c&H525D6C&\frz357.575}o{*\c&H525C6A&\frz357.563}n{*\c&H515C69&\frz357.55}n{*\c&H515B67&\frz357.538}a{*\c&H505A66&\frz357.525}i{*\c&H505A64&\frz357.512}re

28:23.140 --> 28:26.310
Looks like Sasaki-san's gonna be going to a college in Tokyo.

28:26.310 --> 28:30.020
No surprise there. I was thinking of maybe
going to a 2-year college in Kumamoto.

28:30.020 --> 28:31.360
What about you, Kanae?

28:31.360 --> 28:33.650
Huh? Umm...

28:33.650 --> 28:35.070
Will you get a job?

28:35.070 --> 28:36.490
Umm...

28:36.490 --> 28:39.030
You really haven't thought about it at all, huh?

28:39.030 --> 28:40.700
The only thing on your mind is Tohno-kun, right?

28:40.700 --> 28:43.080
He definitely left his girlfriend in Tokyo, I'm telling you.

28:43.080 --> 28:44.370
No way!

29:11.900 --> 29:13.770
Still not going well for you?

29:13.770 --> 29:15.940
Yeah... what's gotten into me?

29:16.820 --> 29:20.990
It's better if you don't think about it too much.
You'll be able to surf again in no time, I promise.

29:20.990 --> 29:23.030
It must be nice taking things so easy, Onee-chan.

29:23.030 --> 29:24.830
What are you in such a rush for?

29:26.740 --> 29:30.580
At this rate, I won't be able to say it before graduation...

29:49.140 --> 29:50.850
Thanks, Onee-chan.

29:50.850 --> 29:51.980
I can take you home, too...

29:51.980 --> 29:54.190
Don't worry about it. I'll take my bike home.

30:21.840 --> 30:23.590
Sumida, you're on your way home?

30:23.590 --> 30:24.430
Yeah.

30:24.890 --> 30:25.850
You too, Tohno-kun?

30:25.850 --> 30:26.640
Yeah.

30:27.180 --> 30:28.470
Wanna go home together?

30:29.470 --> 30:32.230
If I had a tail like a dog's...

30:32.600 --> 30:36.770
...I'm sure it'd be wagging back and forth right now,
since I'd be unable to hide my happiness.

30:37.400 --> 30:42.490
I was sort of relieved and thought to myself,
"Thank goodness I'm not really a dog..."

30:42.490 --> 30:46.370
...and I was surprised at how foolish I was for thinking what I did earlier.

30:46.370 --> 30:50.540
But even still, the trip home with Tohno-kun was bliss.

30:53.710 --> 30:59.460
Right from the start, Tohno-kun seemed
a little different from the other boys.

