30:59.460 --> 31:03.920
Tohno Takaki

31:00.510 --> 31:01.840
I'm Tohno Takaki.

31:01.840 --> 31:04.590
I'm sorta used to transferring 
schools because of my parents' jobs...

31:04.590 --> 31:06.640
...but I'm not too used to this island yet.

31:06.760 --> 31:08.260
It's nice to meet you all.

31:08.260 --> 31:12.890
I fell in love at first sight on that day in the second year of middle
school, and wanted to go to the same high school as him...

31:13.230 --> 31:16.440
...so I studied really hard, was somehow accepted...

31:16.440 --> 31:21.900
...and every single time I saw him, fell more and more in love with him.

31:21.900 --> 31:25.070
But it's so scary, and everyday is painful.

31:25.070 --> 31:27.370
Yet every time I see him, 
I'm filled with such happiness...

31:27.370 --> 31:30.240
...that I'm at a loss for what to do.

31:31.870 --> 31:34.000
Tohno-kun, there you go buying the same one again.

31:34.460 --> 31:35.790
It's really good.

31:36.290 --> 31:39.630
Sumida, you always think your decisions
through seriously, don't you?

31:39.630 --> 31:40.500
Yeah.

31:42.840 --> 31:44.050
I'll be outside.

31:44.630 --> 31:45.420
Yeah.

31:46.130 --> 31:47.220
Just this, please.

31:47.220 --> 31:48.930
That'll be 90 yen.

31:49.140 --> 31:49.930
Here you go.

31:49.930 --> 31:51.260
Thanks as always.

32:02.150 --> 32:03.190
Welcome back.

32:03.190 --> 32:04.280
What'd you buy?

32:04.280 --> 32:07.860
Well, it was hard to pick, but I went with this.

32:05.650 --> 32:09.240
Sometimes, Tohno-kun would be writing a text message...

32:09.240 --> 32:10.910
...and every time he did, I would always wish...

32:10.900 --> 32:14.620
W{*\c&H74716C&\fax0.008}a{*\c&H72716C&\fax0.005}t{*\c&H71706B&\fax0.003}c{*\c&H706F6B&\fax0.001}h{*\c&H6F6E6A&\fax-0.001}i{*\c&H6D6E6A&\fax-0.004}ng O{*\fax-0.013}v{*\fax-0.015}e{*\fax-0.018}r t{*\c&H666868&\fax-0.024}h{*\c&H686969&\fax-0.027}e {*\fax-0.031}E{*\fax-0.034}ar{*\fax-0.038}t{*\fax-0.04}h f{*\fax-0.047}r{*\fax-0.05}o{*\fax-0.052}m {*\fax-0.057}t{*\fax-0.059}h{*\fax-0.061}e {*\fax-0.066}H{*\fax-0.068}e{*\fax-0.071}a{*\fax-0.073}v{*\fax-0.075}e{*\fax-0.078}ns

32:10.910 --> 32:13.740
...that the text message he was writing...

32:14.620 --> 32:18.250
...would be addressed to me.

32:28.010 --> 32:29.390
Kabu, I'm home!

32:29.390 --> 32:30.970
Kabu, Kabu!

32:30.970 --> 32:32.390
I'm back.

32:52.830 --> 32:55.160
This is a message from your town hall.

32:55.160 --> 32:58.290
The next normal open gasoline stand will be at the
Sakai Agricultural Cooperative Gas Station.

32:58.290 --> 33:01.080
Sumida Kanae-san from Class 3-1...

33:01.080 --> 33:02.880
...Itou-sensei is calling for you.

33:02.880 --> 33:04.670
Please report to the Guidance Counselor's office.

33:04.130 --> 33:05.760
Oh, that's your girlfriend.

33:06.010 --> 33:07.510
She's not my girlfriend.

33:07.500 --> 33:13.760
{=50}C{*\frz360.061\fax-0.048}a{*\frz360.04\fax-0.046}r{*\frz360.019\fax-0.044}e{*\frz359.997\fax-0.042}e{*\frz359.976\fax-0.04}r {*\frz359.933\fax-0.035}P{*\frz359.912\fax-0.033}l{*\frz359.89\fax-0.031}a{*\frz359.869\fax-0.029}n {*\frz359.826\fax-0.025}Q{*\frz359.805\fax-0.023}u{*\frz359.784\fax-0.021}e{*\frz359.762\fax-0.019}s{*\frz359.741\fax-0.017}t{*\frz359.72\fax-0.015}i{*\frz359.698\fax-0.012}o{*\frz359.677\fax-0.01}n{*\frz359.655\fax-0.008\c&H383E3D&}n{*\frz359.634\fax-0.006\c&H343A39&}a{*\frz359.613\fax-0.004}i{*\frz359.7\fax-0.002}re

33:07.500 --> 33:13.760
Class: 3-1 Seat: 12

33:07.500 --> 33:13.760
Name: Sumida Kanaede

33:11.050 --> 33:13.760
You're the only one in the grade 
who hasn't filled one out.

33:13.760 --> 33:15.100
I'm sorry.

33:15.100 --> 33:18.140
Look, this isn't something someone 
in my position should be saying...

33:18.140 --> 33:20.600
...but this isn't really something 
you have to wrack your brain over.

33:20.600 --> 33:22.770
Has Sumida-sensei said anything?

33:22.770 --> 33:23.940
No...

33:26.610 --> 33:30.570
If you really can't decide, then how about
a 2-year college within the prefecture?

33:30.570 --> 33:31.530
But...

33:33.570 --> 33:35.950
Onee-chan has nothing to do with it...

33:53.760 --> 33:54.720
After all...

33:56.560 --> 33:59.390
...surfing, even after I pestered
 my sister so much to teach me...

33:59.390 --> 34:02.690
...and the most important guy
 who takes up all of my thoughts...

34:02.690 --> 34:05.940
...are two things I'm still no good at.

34:31.260 --> 34:32.840
Thanks as always.

34:32.840 --> 34:34.180
Not at all. See you next time.

34:34.180 --> 34:35.800
Not at all. See you next time.

35:04.040 --> 35:06.500
Whenever I go to where Tohno-kun is...

35:06.500 --> 35:10.300
...deep down, my heart... 
it clenches up... just a little.

35:11.170 --> 35:12.050
Tohno-kun.

35:12.050 --> 35:15.090
Sumida, what's up? 
I'm surprised you found me way out here.

35:16.180 --> 35:19.510
I saw your bike, so I decided to come on by.

35:19.510 --> 35:20.100
That okay?

35:20.100 --> 35:22.270
Ah, I see. I'm glad to see you.

35:22.850 --> 35:25.560
We didn't run into each other at the bike shed today.

35:25.560 --> 35:26.850
I'm glad, too.

35:27.060 --> 35:28.440
He's really kind.

35:29.150 --> 35:33.150
So kind that sometimes it feels like I'm going to cry.

35:35.400 --> 35:37.490
Hey, are you going to test to get into college?

35:37.490 --> 35:40.410
Yeah. I'm going to take a few
 for some universities in Tokyo.

35:40.410 --> 35:42.120
Tokyo... I see.

35:42.120 --> 35:43.330
Tokyo... I see.

35:43.330 --> 35:45.040
I thought that might be the case.

35:45.830 --> 35:46.870
Why do you say that?

35:46.870 --> 35:50.000
You seem like you want to go
 far away from here, for some reason...

35:50.590 --> 35:51.800
What about you, Sumida?

35:53.170 --> 35:56.590
I don't even really know 
what's going to happen tomorrow.

35:56.590 --> 35:58.550
Everyone's the same.

35:58.550 --> 36:00.550
No way! You too, Tohno-kun?

36:00.550 --> 36:01.470
Of course.

36:02.350 --> 36:05.180
You don't look like you have anything to worry about.

36:05.180 --> 36:08.480
Oh, stop that. I'm filled with nothing but worries.

36:08.480 --> 36:12.110
I'm doing all that I can just to keep up. I have no breathing room.

36:12.780 --> 36:13.820
Really?

36:14.940 --> 36:16.200
I see...

36:23.700 --> 36:25.040
A plane?

36:25.040 --> 36:25.790
Yeah.

36:45.510 --> 36:48.100
